hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"59","[AI-translation] Salih bin Khawwat (Rahimahullah) se us se riwayat hai jis ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Zaat-ur-Riqa wale din salat-ul-khauf padhi: Ke ek giroh ne Aap ke sath saf bandhi, aur ek giroh dushman ke samne [khada] raha. To Aap ne un ke sath jo Aap ke sath the ek rak'at padhi, phir khade rahe. 'Aur unhon ne apne liye [dusri rak'at akele] poori ki, phir wapas gae aur dushman ke samne saf bandhi. Aur dusra giroh aaya.' To Aap ne un ke sath Apni namaz ki baqi reh jaane wali rak'at padhi, phir baithe rahe. 'Aur unhon ne apne liye [dusri rak'at akele] poori ki, phir Aap ne un ke sath salam phera.'"
"60","[AI-translation] Salih bin Khawwat bin Jubair (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Malik ki Yazid bin Ruman se [salat-ul-khauf ki] hadees ke ma'na jaise [riwayat] hai."
"61","[AI-translation] Hazrat Suhaib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se guzra, to main ne Aap ko salam kiya [jabke Aap namaz mein the], to Aap ne meri taraf ishare se jawab diya. Aur unhon ne kaha: Main nahin janta magar yeh ke unhon ne kaha: Aap ne Apni ungli se ishara farmaya tha."
"62","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek hajat ke liye bheja, phir main Aap se ja mila jabke Aap chal rahe the. To main ne Aap ko salam kiya, to Aap ne meri taraf ishara farmaya [kyunke namaz mein the]. Phir jab Aap farigh hue to mujhe bulaya aur farmaya: 'Beshak tum ne abhi mujhe salam kiya tha jabke main namaz padh raha tha.' Aur Aap us waqt mashriq ki taraf munh kiye hue the [sawari par nafl padh rahe the]."
"63","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kiya karte the jabke Aap namaz mein hote, is se pehle ke ham Habsha ki zameen mein aate; to Aap ham ko jawab dete jabke Aap namaz mein hote. Phir jab ham Habsha ki zameen se wapas aae to main Aap ko salam karne ke liye Aap ke paas aaya. To main ne Aap ko namaz padhte paya, aur main ne Aap ko salam kiya, magar Aap ne mujhe jawab nahin diya. To mujhe qareeb aur door [ki fikren] lagin. Phir main baith gaya, yahan tak ke jab Aap Apni namaz se farigh hue to main Aap ke paas aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah Apne mamle mein se jo chahta hai naya [hukm] farmata hai; aur beshak us mein se jo Us ne naya [hukm] farmaya hai yeh hai ke Us ne faisla farmaya hai ke tum namaz mein baat na karo.'"
"64","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek masjid mein dakhil hue [aur] us mein namaz padhne lage; aur Ansar mein se chand aadmi Aap ke paas dakhil hue aur Aap ko salam kiya. To main ne Suhaib se poocha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ko kaise jawab dete the? Unhon ne kaha: Woh un ko ishare se jawab dete the."
"65","[AI-translation] Ata bin Abi Rabah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aadmi jab ata jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Apni namaz mein se kuch padh chuke hote to poochta [muqtadi se ke kitni reh gayi]; phir jab use khabar di jati ke kitni reh gayi hai to reh jaane wali [akele] padhta, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Aap ki namaz mein dakhil hota. Phir Ibn Mas'ud aae aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Aap ki namaz mein dakhil hue baghair pooche. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padh li to woh khade hue aur baqi [reh jaane wali] qaza ki. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Ibn Mas'ud ne tumhare liye ek sunnat jari ki hai, to us ki pairwi karo.' Sufyan kehte hain: Aur Amr ke siwa ghair ne kaha: Woh Mu'adh [Ibn Mas'ud nahin] hai."
"66","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum namaz ke paas aao to us ke paas daudte hue na aao; us ke paas chalte hue aao, aur tum par sukoon lazim hai. Jo tum pao [imam ke sath], to use padho; aur jo tum se reh jae, to use qaza karo.'"
"67","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum iqamat suno to [namaz ki taraf] chalte hue aao aur tum par sukoon lazim hai. Jo tum pao to use padho; aur jo tum se reh jae to use poora karo.'"
"68","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab namaz ke liye [iqamat se] pukara jae to us ke paas daudte hue na aao; us ke paas aao aur tum par sukoon lazim hai. Jo tum pao to use padho; aur jo tum se reh jae to use poora karo. Kyunke tum mein se ek namaz mein [shumar] hai jab tak woh namaz ki taraf jane ka qasd kiye hue hai.'"
"69","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, woh kaha karti thin: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fajr ki do rak'aten [sunnat] padhte aur inhen halka farmate, yahan tak ke main kehti: Kya Aap ne in mein Ummul Quran [Al-Fatihah] padhi hai?"
"70","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz ki iqamat ke ba'd takbeer se pehle Apne chehre se sahaba ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: 'Apni safen seedhi karo aur mil kar khade ho; beshak main tumhen Apni pusht ke peeche se dekhta hun.'"
"71","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Umm Sulaim [Raziyallahu anha] ke paas tashreef le jate; to woh Aap ke liye chamde ka bistar bichhatin, aur Aap us par qailula farmate. To woh Aap ke paseene mein se lekar use Apne khushbu mein dal tin; aur woh Aap ke liye khumrah [chhoti chatai] bichhatin, phir Aap us par namaz padhte."
"72","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ke kalime dohre kahen aur iqamat ke kalime ekhre [taaq]."
"73","[AI-translation] Malik bin Huwairis Abu Sulaiman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas logon ke sath aaya, jabke ham hum-umr naujawan the, phir ham Aap ke paas bees raaten thehre. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raheem the; jab Aap ne gumaan farmaya ke ham apne ghar walon ke mushtaq ho gae hain, to Aap ne ham se un ke bare mein poocha jinen ham apne peeche chhor aae the, to ham ne Aap ko khabar di. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas jao, un mein thahro, unhen sikhao, aur unhen hukm do.' Aur unhon ne chand cheezen zikr kin jo mujhe yaad hain aur jo yaad nahin: 'Aur namaz padho jaise tum ne mujhe namaz padhte dekha hai. Jab namaz ka waqt aa jae to tum mein se ek tumhare liye azan kahe, aur tum mein se bada tumhari imamat kare.'"
